body:
One of the most important questions I can think of is this. How easy is it to fling open and can you easily set the tricorder sound effect from Star Trek the Original Series?

@ 1:30 It's mind boggling that the Anker 45w charger was faster to completion than the Apple 96w charger. How bad must Apple be if they can have nearly double the wattage and still charge it slower?

@4:31 In Samsung's defense, with One UI 7 you can change the setting so that notifications and quick settings are on one swipe-down panel and so you don't need to target a specific corner for one or the other. It's an option, since you can change it back in settings.
